<h2 class="kt-adv-heading1227_9796de-00 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading1227_9796de-00">Directions</h2>



<p class="kt-adv-heading1227_4c14fc-7d wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading1227_4c14fc-7d"></p>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1227_6aeb67-10"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"></div></div>

</div></div>

<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id1227_9ffe5e-ce alignnone kt-row-has-bg wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-row kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top kb-theme-content-width">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1227_5b9177-5d inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h2 class="kt-adv-heading1227_a47a3d-4a wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading1227_a47a3d-4a">Camp Details</h2>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1227_2bc093-cd"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p><strong>Time:</strong> 9 am &#8211; 4 pm</p>



<p><strong>Dates:</strong> July 20th &#8211; July 23rd</p>



<p><strong>Grade Levels: </strong>1-8&nbsp;</p>



<p><strong>Cost: </strong>$300</p>



<p><strong>Instructor:</strong> Scott Heath</p>



<p><strong>Contact Info</strong>: 207-780-5474</p>



<p><strong>Camp capacity:</strong> 200</p>



<p><strong>Is lunch provided?: </strong>No</p>
</div></div>

</div></div>


<h3 class="kt-adv-heading1227_2f1c49-03 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading1227_2f1c49-03">About The Camp</h3>



<p>Under the direction of USM Head Coach Scott Heath, assistant USM coaches, visiting coaches and college players this will be an outstanding week of baseball. This camp is intended to teach the players the fundamentals of baseball.&nbsp;</p>



<p>Players will receive both individual and team instruction. The staff will give the beginning player the necessary skills to compete and will challenge even the most advanced youngster. The emphasis in instruction will be centered on hitting, throwing, fielding, pitching, and base running.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-1227_614961-dc"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>



<p><strong>Packing list:</strong></p>



<p>Lunch</p>



<p>T-Shirts</p>



<p>Athletic Shorts</p>



<p>Athletic Socks</p>



<p>Athletic Shoes</p>



<p>Baseball Pants</p>



<p>Baseball Cleats</p>



<p>Baseball Glove</p>



<p>Baseball Bat and Helmet (optional)</p>



<p>Shoes To Wear Coming Into &amp; Out Of The Building</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-1227_4cb6a1-19"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>



<p><strong>Pick up and Drop off:</strong>&nbsp;</p>



<p>Camper check-in on the first day begins at 8:30 AM, with camp starting at 9:00 AM.</p>



<p>Check-in will occur at the main entrance to Costello Sports Complex.</p>



<p>Campers can arrive at 9:00 AM each morning. Pick-up must occur by 4:00 PM.</p>



<p>Please note that there is a strict 30 minute grace period for parking. Vehicles on campus for longer than 30 minutes must pay for parking.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-1227_590ab0-68"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>



<p><strong>Medical:&nbsp;</strong></p>



<p>USM has partnered with ePact for secure HIPPA complaint data collection, all waivers as well as camper check in and check out will be managed through ePact moving forward.</p>



<p>After completing your registration within the next 24 hours you will receive an email from ePact prompting you to sign up and complete the waiver.&nbsp;</p>



<p>If you have any questions about ePact, please see the following: <a href="https://usm.maine.edu/sports-camps-clinics/epact/">https://usm.maine.edu/sports-camps-clinics/epact/</a></p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-1227_f3b3a2-91"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>



<p><strong>Cancellation/Refund Policy:</strong></p>



<p>A full refund will be given up until 2 weeks prior to the start of camp.<br>A 50% refund will be given for cancellations within two weeks prior to the start of camp, unless there is a documented injury or bereavement. There are no refunds for no shows.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-spacer aligncenter kt-block-spacer-1227_a0efa7-f5"><div class="kt-block-spacer kt-block-spacer-halign-center"><hr class="kt-divider"/></div></div>


<div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id1227_291e4c-f1 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-2-columns kt-row-layout-row kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1227_6e25fd-7e inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<h2 class="kt-adv-heading1227_867271-22 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading1227_867271-22">Official Athletics Social Media Channels</h2>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1227_429647-7b inner-column-2"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id1227_242da6-33 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-5-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1227_0d8aa0-ba inner-column-1"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"></div></div>



